{
  "slug": "raii-smart-pointers",
  "title": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "e4a5ab9f-5832-4aae-8e25-ac4cb5177afc",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 0,
      "data": {
        "title": "RAII em uma frase"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "7d4a3546-0234-40f8-8dba-42380879701b",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Resource Acquisition Is Initialization: todo recurso é encapsulado num objeto cujo construtor adquire e cujo destrutor libera. O stack unwinding garante liberação automática em qualquer caminho de saída — inclusive exceção. "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f5d752d2-16b6-407c-8351-1cbe5ab7cdc7",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "cpp",
            "code": "#include <fstream>\n\nvoid write_log(const std::string& msg) {\n    std::ofstream f(\"app.log\", std::ios::app);\n    f << msg << '\\n';\n    // destrutor fecha e flush automaticamente ao sair do escopo,\n    // mesmo se msg lançar, mesmo se f << lançar\n}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c4c97425-b71d-49ee-af57-864b292be872",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 1,
      "data": {
        "title": "unique_ptr: ownership único"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "cd1aa18c-eddf-42ee-8321-68940312818c",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "cpp",
            "code": "#include <memory>\n\nstruct Sensor { /* ... */ };\n\nstd::unique_ptr<Sensor> make_sensor() {\n    return std::make_unique<Sensor>();  // zero overhead vs new\n}\n\nvoid use() {\n    auto s = make_sensor();              // move-transfer\n    // ... s.get(), s->method() ...\n}   // destrutor libera automaticamente"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "07c94169-9ed2-4db6-8646-ba6633b52a5d",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "unique_ptr",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " é zero-cost: tamanho do ptr cru, sem refcount. Transferência de ownership via move — "
              },
              {
                "text": "std::move(up)",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " entrega posse e deixa origem vazia. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5c9db3b1-bfff-47ec-8ac3-2afe497355f8",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 2,
      "data": {
        "title": "shared_ptr: ownership compartilhado"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "6197b72b-3380-4089-bdc6-0622b09dffc2",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "cpp",
            "code": "auto cfg = std::make_shared<Config>();\nworker_a.set_config(cfg);\nworker_b.set_config(cfg);\n// refcount = 3; libera quando último sai"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f1a7d058-8afd-46ed-aa1d-8c0c8932dd30",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "variant": "warning",
            "title": "",
            "content": "shared_ptr paga preço: control block heap-allocado, atomic refcount, 2x ptr size. Use quando ownership compartilhado é intencional — não como muleta."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "267cdd87-16bb-442e-ae42-32f8e41bfb19",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 3,
      "data": {
        "title": "weak_ptr: observador sem ownership"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "68bc5e86-1d92-4956-b2d0-5031e7fc33c6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Quebra ciclos. Caso clássico: "
              },
              {
                "text": "Parent",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " tem "
              },
              {
                "text": "shared_ptr<Child>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", "
              },
              {
                "text": "Child",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " precisa referenciar "
              },
              {
                "text": "Parent",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " sem estender sua vida. Usa "
              },
              {
                "text": "weak_ptr<Parent>",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", promote para shared apenas quando for usar. "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "011cdbd2-8cbd-4149-a428-c49e6fc77e29",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "cpp",
            "code": "std::weak_ptr<Parent> w = p_shared;\nif (auto p = w.lock()) {     // tentativa de promote\n    p->do_something();\n} else {\n    // parent já morreu\n}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1020725-32aa-485c-8602-a47a4adafdf0",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 4,
      "data": {
        "title": "Raw pointer: apenas para non-owning view"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "c4b09bbd-e6ac-418b-bc15-60de529816e7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Em C++ moderno, "
              },
              {
                "text": "T*",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " significa \"observo, não possuo\". Se função aceita "
              },
              {
                "text": "T*",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ", não deve chamar delete. Para \"pode ser null\", use "
              },
              {
                "text": "T*",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ". Para \"nunca null, non-owning\", use "
              },
              {
                "text": "T&",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": ". "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a7581346-0490-4150-a4a0-959ef2c33e32",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 5,
      "data": {
        "title": "Rule of 5 → Rule of 0"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "38b4c5af-c600-4eb7-9ea2-e4f6a5b88a04",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "cpp",
            "code": "// ❌ Rule of 5 legacy: escrevendo tudo manual\nclass Buffer {\n    char *data_;\n    size_t n_;\npublic:\n    Buffer(size_t n);\n    ~Buffer();\n    Buffer(const Buffer&);\n    Buffer& operator=(const Buffer&);\n    Buffer(Buffer&&) noexcept;\n    Buffer& operator=(Buffer&&) noexcept;\n};\n\n// ✅ Rule of 0 moderno: composição com RAII\nclass Buffer {\n    std::unique_ptr<char[]> data_;\n    size_t n_;\npublic:\n    Buffer(size_t n)\n        : data_(std::make_unique<char[]>(n)), n_(n) {}\n    // compilador gera move corretamente, copy é deletado por unique_ptr\n};"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d586c5c2-9c56-4819-b98c-069609c6347d",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 6,
      "data": {
        "title": "Checklist"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "6c50119b-97df-4526-9383-51ab0052e528",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "variant": "success",
            "title": "",
            "content": "(1) Zero new e delete à vista. (2) make_unique/make_shared por default. (3) Membros são smart pointers ou containers padrão. (4) Se escreveu destructor, justifique — Rule of 0 é default."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}